    今日の難易度を<br class="sm:hidden">選ぼう
  </h1>

  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 max-w-sm mx-auto">
    <%= link_to "かんたん", question_path(difficulty: "easy"), class: "w-full text-center py-3 rounded-full shadow bg-emerald-400 text-white font-bold" %>
    <%= link_to "ふつう", question_path(difficulty: "normal"), class: "w-full text-center py-3 rounded-full shadow bg-amber-400 text-white font-bold" %>
